---
source: src/bottom_pane/chat_composer.rs
expression: "rows(&shortcuts, 100, super::desired_height(&shortcuts, 100))"
---
                                                                                                    
  › Ask Atlas to do anything                                                                        
  / for commands                                                                                    
  shift + enter for newline                       tab to submit message                             
  @ for file paths                                                                                  
  ctrl + g to edit in external editor             esc again to edit previous message                
  ctrl + r search history                         ctrl + c to exit                                  
  ctrl + t to view transcript
